.TH FBAPPSELECT 1 "2026-09-10" "flux-tools 2.0.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
fbappselect \- application launcher for FluxBox desktop
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B fbappselect
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B fbappselect
displays a graphical application launcher using xlunch. It generates a grid-based menu showing available desktop applications with icons for easy selection.
.PP
The xlunch_genquick generator handles desktop entry visibility, including
NoDisplay and Hidden. This launcher does not maintain a separate application
filter. Default Flux shortcuts are created by fbdesktop; fbliveapp removes their
package launcher duplicates after successful installation.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR xlunch (1),
.BR fluxbox (1)
.SH AUTHOR
Tomas-M <https://github.com/Tomas-M>
crims0n <crims0n@minios.dev>
.SH NOTES
Desktop entries are launched by gio launch, or gtk-launch on older GLib versions. Quoting, field codes, TryExec, Path and Terminal are handled by the desktop launcher. Free-form input runs in a terminal. Concurrent invocations on one display do not create duplicate menus or terminate other xlunch windows.
